    '$\sin(\pi+x) = -\sin x$, $\cos(\frac{\pi}{2}-x) = \sin x$ ve $\tan(\pi-x) = -\tan x = -\frac{\sin x}{\cos x}$. Oran $\frac{-\sin^2 x}{-\sin x / \cos x} = \sin x \cos x$ olur.', 85, 1.00, 0.2500, 'PUBLISHED',
